#: .\templates\home.html:10
msgid "Exploring the Sound of Science"
msgstr "Exploring the Sound of Science"

#: .\templates\home.html:13
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Exploring the cosmos through different senses "
"can be within your reach. That's why this platform for training in the "
"sonification of astronomical data and more was created. In the convergence "
"between astronomy and data sonification, we have created a unique space that "
"goes beyond visual representation, allowing you to discover the universe in "
"a multisensory way.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Exploring the cosmos through different senses "
"can be within your reach. That's why this platform for training in the "
"sonification of astronomical data and more was created. In the convergence "
"between astronomy and data sonification, we have created a unique space that "
"goes beyond visual representation, allowing you to discover the universe in "
"a multisensory way.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    "

#: .\templates\home.html:22
msgid "About Us"
msgstr "About Us"

#: .\templates\home.html:24
msgid ""
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    In sonoTrainings, we merge vision and hearing to provide "
"you with multisensory training that not only expands your understanding of "
"the cosmos but also enhances your auditory performance when interacting with "
"scientific data. Inspired by innovative projects like sonoUno, our platform "
"focuses on designing a user-centered interface to make science accessible to "
"everyone.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    In sonoTrainings, we merge vision and hearing to provide "
"you with multisensory training that not only expands your understanding of "
"the cosmos but also enhances your auditory performance when interacting with "
"scientific data. Inspired by innovative projects like sonoUno, our platform "
"focuses on designing a user-centered interface to make science accessible to "
"everyone.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "

#: .\templates\home.html:30
msgid "Highlighted Features:"
msgstr "Highlighted Features:"

#: .\templates\home.html:32
msgid ""
"\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        \n"
"                        Multisensory Training:\n"
"                        <p>Immerse yourself in unique learning experiences "
"that combine vision and hearing to enhance understanding of astronomical and "
"scientific data.</p>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        Accessibility:\n"
"                        <p>Our platform was designed with the diversity of "
"sensory styles in mind, making science accessible to everyone.</p>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        Continuous Development:\n"
"                        <p>We are committed to the continuous improvement of "
"our platform, ensuring user-friendly functionality that guarantees a "
"comfortable learning experience.</p>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>Join us and discover the cosmos in an entirely new way on "
"sonoTrainings.</p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        \n"
"                        Multisensory Training:\n"
"                        <p>Immerse yourself in unique learning experiences "
"that combine vision and hearing to enhance understanding of astronomical and "
"scientific data.</p>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        Accessibility:\n"
"                        <p>Our platform was designed with the diversity of "
"sensory styles in mind, making science accessible to everyone.</p>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        Continuous Development:\n"
"                        <p>We are committed to the continuous improvement of "
"our platform, ensuring user-friendly functionality that guarantees a "
"comfortable learning experience.</p>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>Join us and discover the cosmos in an entirely new way on "
"sonoTrainings.</p>\n"
"            "

